{"code":"000087","name":"하이트진로2우B","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"음료","sector_desc":"주류·음료 제조. 경기 방어적이며 가격 인상과 원가 관리가 실적 핵심입니다.","desc":"동사는 1924년 설립된 종합주류판매기업으로 20개의 계열사를 보유하고 있으며, 주요 종속회사로 하이트진로음료, 하이트진로산업, 블루헤런 등이 있음. 소주 부문은 '참이슬'과 '진로'로 국내 시장을 선도하고, 맥주 부문은 '테라', '켈리', '필라이트' 등 다양한 제품을 구축하고 있음. 생수 부문은 '석수'로 18년 연속 퍼스트 브랜드 대상을 수상하며, '블랙보리' 등 음료 포트폴리오를 다변화하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":12450.0,"open":12310.0,"high":12450.0,"low":11890.0,"volume":1141,"amount":14205450.0,"ret_1d":1.1373,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":4.498,"ret_5":-0.4,"ret_20":0.8914,"ret_60":1.2195,"ret_120":-11.1983,"ret_250":-19.7809,"ma20":12307.0,"ma60":12328.1667,"ma120":12693.9167,"ma200":13335.75,"close_vs_ma200":-6.6419,"close_vs_ma60":0.9883,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.2921,"r2_60":0.001,"slope_120":-23.3318,"r2_120":0.6361,"slope_250":-24.9872,"r2_250":0.9293,"high52":15650.0,"low52":11700.0,"pos_52w":18.9873,"dd_52w":-20.4473,"mdd_1y":-22.0721,"atr14_pct":2.4727,"vol_ann_60":11.0943,"vol_avg20":978.6,"vol_ratio20":1.166,"vr5":0.9316,"vr20":0.4247,"amount_avg5":20045638.0,"amount_avg20":12030303.0,"amount_avg60":19852882.5,"obv_chg20":15.0317,"turnover_20":1.7318,"pv_eff_20":0.5147,"rsi14":55.883,"frgn_net_5":-18.0,"inst_net_5":393.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0016,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0348,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0332,"frgn_net_20":-14.0,"inst_net_20":455.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0012,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0403,"smart_net_20_pct":0.039,"frgn_net_60":-446.0,"inst_net_60":781.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0395,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0691,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0296,"frgn_net_120":-49.0,"inst_net_120":285.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.0043,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0252,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0209,"foreign_ratio":3.45,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":1.4,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":649.0,"op_margin_q":10.4914,"op_qoq":16.1002,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":0.6202,"rev_yoy":-4.3303,"op_trend_4q":20.9544,"fin_period":"202606","roe":4.09,"debt_ratio":172.65,"per":18.84,"pbr":0.75,"div_yield":6.02,"forei